<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Kian Joo 6-mth net up four pct. [CORRECTED 03:20 GMT]</title>
<headline>Malaysia Kian Joo 6-mth net up four pct. [CORRECTED 03:20 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30</p>
<p>(Corrects date from period to July 31)</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  31.52   vs	  30.21</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 27.2    vs	  26.1</p>
<p>    Turnover		   219.10   vs	 210.78</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    43.32   vs	  38.45</p>
<p>    Minorities		    -     vs	    -</p>
<p>    Dividend   (cents)	 5.0    vs	   5.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Kian Joo Can Factory Bhd makes tin cans, two-piece aluminium cans and related products.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
